I'm pleased to announce hledger 1.99.5, the fifth preview of hledger 2.0!

hledger (https://hledger.org) is accounting software, for both
beginners and experts, using human-readable, version-controllable,
future-proof plain text files.  It's dependable, free, fast, friendly,
cross-platform, double-entry, multi-currency, multi-interface,
multi-language, GPL-licensed, and fun to use.


hledger 1.99.5 (2.0 preview release 5) brings some big improvements:

- the fastest hledger yet (4x faster than 1.99.4)
- UI translations (--lang)
- find-anywhere query (::)
- compact transactions report
- lossless print --export
- CSV multi-record merge rule
- journals can include CSV & rules files
- simpler balancing and gains using cost basis
- lot tracking fixes, short positions
- hledger-ui auto-updates by default
- hledger-web balance reports, paging, dark mode.

There are a few breaking changes; see the release notes.

